    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d389-a6">

                <pb facs="0918" n="822" sameAs="frus:frus1879/pg822"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 6 in No.
                    1002.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ruelas to Mr.
                            Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-07-26"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 26,
                        1879</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In reply to your excellency’s note of
                    yesterday, I have the honor to send to you inclosed the certificate of
                    matriculation which has been issued to Mr. Blanchard B. Kelly as a citizen of
                    the United States of America, and I return to you his passport.</p>
                <p>I have the satisfaction of renewing to your excellency the assurances of my
                    distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed>M. RUELAS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
